---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import NextStep from '../components/NextStep.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 - 页面未找到 | 机场推荐 Club"
  description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移动。请访问我们的首页或使用导航探索最新知识库与机场推荐。"
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-2xl font-mono font-bold mb-6">
      404
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white mb-3">
      信号丢失：页面未找到
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-300 mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">
      您访问的 URL 路径可能已被更新或重构。请尝试通过以下核心入口继续浏览：
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs mb-12">
      <a href="/" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-cyan-500/10 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-400">
        返回首页
      </a>
      <a href="/airport-ranking/" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-cyan-500/10 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-400">
        机场排行榜
      </a>
      <a href="/tutorial/" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-cyan-500/10 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-400">
        客户端教程
      </a>
      <a href="/troubleshooting/" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-cyan-500/10 border border-white/5 text-slate-200 hover:text-cyan-400">
        故障排查
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
